 "_ghi_chu": "Mo hinh nhan dang giong noi bo sung cho che do dich: Whisper large-v3 (faster-whisper, CTranslate2) va FireRedASR2-AED int8 (ONNX, chay bang sherpa-onnx), chep nguyen ban tu HuggingFace len GitHub Release rieng (workflow asr-models.yml dang). scripts/lay_asr.py tai tu release truoc, HuggingFace o dung revision duoi la du phong; ca hai deu kiem sha256. File nao lon hon 2 GiB (gioi han moi file cua GitHub Release) thi chia thanh parts (cat bang split -b 1500M -d -a 2), lay_asr.py ghep lai roi kiem sha256 file day du. Doi revision: dat release_tag moi, cap nhat revision, size, sha256 tung file theo API HuggingFace, chay thu dau cuoi. Khong xoa hay tao lai release da dang.",
